From b1ec485ea679b1f075feabf92211b1420c0f968b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <tristan75015@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 11:12:03 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Test and document the nodal blocks of the operator applied
 without assembly

BatchIntegrationTest compares the nodal blocks of the tangent operator
applied without assembly with the ones of the assembled tangent operator
(diagonal block of the process in parallel), in all its matrix free cases
(standard behaviour integrators in 3D and in plane strain, two materials,
FBar formulation, regularization of Faltus et al., essential degrees of
freedom), and solves with the Jacobi preconditioner by nodal blocks in
3D, in plane strain, with the FBar formulation and with the
regularization of Faltus et al.
